                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Frederica Charlotte Ulrica Catherina [Princess Frederica of Prussia] (1767–1820) was the
    eldest daughter of Frederick William II, king of Prussia, and his first wife, Elizabeth of Brunswick.  She married 
    <persName key="FRE03">Frederick, Prince, duke of York and Albany</persName> (1763–1827), army officer and bishop of Osnabrück, the 
    second son of <persName key="GEO03">George III</persName> and Queen Charlotte, in 1791.</p>
                        <p>Godwin recorded her death.</p>
                    </note>
